cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these measurements or the patch, please cite this repository."
title: "SpacemiT K3 LLM inference notes: llama.cpp on the IME2 / A100 cores"
abstract: >-
  Measurements of LLM generation and embeddings on a SpacemiT K3 Pico-ITX (8 GB, Bianbu 4.0.1) with
  upstream llama.cpp, llama.cpp-tools-spacemit and Ollama, including a one-line fix for wrong
  token-by-token decode in the IME2 flash-attention kernel of llama.cpp.
type: dataset
authors:
