  - MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/AI-Arch-DK/spacemit-k3-llm-inference-notes"
keywords:
  - SpacemiT K3
  - K3 Pico-ITX
  - RISC-V
  - llama.cpp
  - IME2
  - LLM inference
  - Qwen2.5
  - Qwen3-Embedding
